# P102 on iOS (UIKitBackend), through XCUITest: a mousedown then a mouseup with micros is
# press(forDuration: micros, thenDragTo:, withVelocity: 300, thenHoldForDuration: 0.3) -- a held press, then a drag.
# Positions from p102-ios-final-20261017-025856.png (1179x2556 px = 393x852 pt at 3x, the swift-cross-ui simulator):
# FIELD text at y 214, EDITOR lines at y 273/291/310, CONTROL at y 422.
# Pass (p102-select.log): FIELD began with an empty range then ended forward and non-empty; EDITOR ended backward;
# no line for the CONTROL long press or for the quick FIELD drag at the end (held 0.1 s: UIKit's own handling).
